+## Delivered scope
+
+- Added official remote Swift Package Manager dependency Sparkle 2.9.4 only to
+  `ReluxProxyMac`. `.package.resolved` pins revision
+  `b6496a74a087257ef5e6da1c5b29a447a60f5bd7`.
